<ResourceDictionary xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
                    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml">

  <!--
    Seed exceptions, not a palette. Three seeds in App.xaml generate every semantic role; the roles
    below are the ones the generator's recipe structurally cannot reach, so they are pinned back to
    the authored brand value. Colors.OverrideSource merges last and wins over the generated palette,
    and Uno.Themes rewrites the matching *Brush keys (and their hover/pressed/disabled variants)
    from these values.

    Both themes are declared for every role on purpose: the brush resolver probes Light then
    Default, so a role given only a Default value would bleed its dark color into light.

    This app needs the most exceptions because its palette was the least M3-shaped to begin with: a
    bright amber tertiary and flat grey outlines are exactly what the tonal recipe normalizes away.

    Why these:
    - SecondaryColor / TertiaryColor — only the light PrimaryColor is the seed verbatim under
      SeedColorMode.Fidelity; Secondary and Tertiary are pinned to tone 40 in light and tone 80 in
      dark. The CRM's status blue and amber sit far from both, so they darken in light and go pastel
      in dark.
    - OutlineColor — the neutral-variant palette is capped at chroma 8 and lands mid-tone, which
      replaces the deliberately light dividers with heavy grey rules.
    - SecondaryContainerColor / TertiaryContainerColor (dark) — drawn from the same pinned palettes
      and shift with them.
  -->
  <ResourceDictionary.ThemeDictionaries>

    <ResourceDictionary x:Key="Light">
      <Color x:Key="SecondaryColor">#3B82F6</Color>
      <Color x:Key="TertiaryColor">#F59E0B</Color>
      <Color x:Key="OutlineColor">#CBCBCB</Color>
      <Color x:Key="SecondaryContainerColor">#EFF4FF</Color>
      <Color x:Key="TertiaryContainerColor">#FFF5E7</Color>
    </ResourceDictionary>

    <ResourceDictionary x:Key="Default">
      <Color x:Key="SecondaryColor">#5B97F7</Color>
      <Color x:Key="TertiaryColor">#F6AE33</Color>
      <Color x:Key="OutlineColor">#3B4448</Color>
      <Color x:Key="SecondaryContainerColor">#17263E</Color>
      <Color x:Key="TertiaryContainerColor">#332915</Color>
    </ResourceDictionary>

  </ResourceDictionary.ThemeDictionaries>
</ResourceDictionary>
